# Room 16: the Dragon's Cave, under the cold reactor. Daylight on the
# left, a shelf of rock in the middle where the dragon sits, one path
# along the lava, and the Mirror's niche on the right.
# Outlines first, fills after: a fill only replaces white. Lines drawn in
# color 0 vanish into the black wall: they only fence off the glow.

